          "postData": {
            "text": "{\"id\":\"ae1f61b1-f579-4514-9837-611b2dec24c4\",\"content\":{\"question\":\"hi\",\"type\":\"text\",\"status\":\"processing\",\"source\":\"agent\",\"created_at\":1792475964,\"updated_at\":1792475964,\"chat_list\":[{\"label\":\"hi\",\"question\":\"hi\",\"answer\":[\"\"],\"reasoning\":[{\"startedAt\":null,\"endedAt\":null,\"reasoning\":\"\",\"thinkingSeconds\":0}],\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"The user just said \\\"hi\\\". This is a simple greeting/conversational. I should respond with the self-introduction.\\n\\nThe self-introduction rule applies when the user asks who I am or what I can do. Just \\\"hi\\\" is a greeting — I can respond with a friendly greeting and self-introduction since it's the first message.\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-20T05:59:29.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-10-20T05:59:30.000Z\",\"thinkingSeconds\":1},{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"Hi~ 👋 Nice to meet you! I'm NoteGPT's AI Agent. I can work based on your needs or goals, automatically make a plan, research and organize information, analyze files and data, and handle multi-step tasks to deliver a polished result you can use right away.\\n\\nFor example:\\n- If you're a **Student**, I can turn your course materials, papers, and notes into study guides, review plans, and practice questions to help you prepare more efficiently, and more.\\n- If you're an **Educator**, I can help create lesson plans, class activities, teaching materials, and learning resources tailored to your students, and more.\\n- If you're a **Professional**, I can analyze data, research markets and competitors, organize meeting materials, and create reports, proposals, presentations, and more.\\n- If you're a **Researcher**, I can dive deep on a topic, find and verify sources, compare different perspectives, synthesize findings, and create well-cited research reports, and more.\\n- If you're a **Creator**, I can turn an idea into researched, well-planned content, from articles and blog posts to podcast scripts, newsletters, and social media posts, and more.\\n\\nAnd that's just the beginning. Tell me what you want to get done, and I'll take it from there.\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-20T05:59:30.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-10-20T05:59:31.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":1,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-20T05:59:31.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":1,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-20T05:59:31.000Z\"}],\"isStreaming\":false,\"isInterrupted\":false,\"generatedFiles\":[],\"conversation_id\":\"ae1f61b1-f579-4514-9837-611b2dec24c4\",\"created_at\":1792475959229,\"fileInfo\":null,\"fileInfos\":null,\"modelValue\":\"deepseek-flash\",\"isAutoModel\":true,\"historyId\":\"ae1f61b1-f579-4514-9837-611b2dec24c4\",\"isStopped\":false,\"lastMsgId\":\"1792475971269-0\",\"creditsUsed\":1}]}}"
          }
